flowchart TD
  HR[HR Dashboard React] --> API[Express API / Auth / Zod]
  API --> XLSX[ExcelJS preview / import / export]
  API --> DB[(SQLite persistent volume)]
  API --> Scheduler[Persistent scheduler / retries]
  Scheduler --> Guard[Consent / Opt-out / Rate / Concurrency]
  Guard --> Adapter{Provider selection}
  Adapter --> Mock[Mock deterministic simulator]
  Adapter --> ARI[Asterisk ARI local SIP]
  ARI --> Softphone[SIP extensions 1001 / 1002]
  Mock --> Events[Call outcomes: DTMF 1 / 2 / none]
  ARI --> Events
  Events --> DB
  DB --> Reports[Analytics + Excel reports]
  Reports --> HR
